* Generic MOSFET for sensitivity sweeps (datasheet-level, NOT a vendor model):
*   ron  = on-resistance at Vgs~4.5 V, cg = effective gate capacitance (Qg@5V ~ cg*5V),
*   coss = output capacitance (linear), vth ~ 2 V, body diode included
.subckt GENFET d g s ron=10m cg=2n coss=300p
S1 d s g s swg
.model swg sw(vt=2.0 vh=0.3 ron={ron} roff=1e8)
Dbd s d dbg
.model dbg D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=5m CJO=1p TT=20n)
Cgs g s {cg}
Cds d s {coss}
.ends
